  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 808.12 Di(2-ethylhexyl)phthalate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 808.12 Di(2-ethylhexyl)phthalate. For di (2-ethylhexyl)phthalate violations, the statement shall read as follows:\n\n“Some people who drink water containing di (2-ethylhexyl) phthalate well in excess of the MCL over many years may have problems with their liver, or experience reproductive difficulties, and may have an increased risk of getting cancer.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 800) #9730, eff 6-30-10; ss by #12675, eff 1-1-19",
